<h1>Both daemons accept <code>--env-file</code></h1>
<p>With {{ release.tag }}, <code>dekopon-gatewayd</code> and <code>dekopon-brokerd</code> each load their secrets from a private file, so a launchd job or service unit starts the binary directly instead of through a wrapper script.</p>
